# You do NOT need this file to run the tool.
#
# The normal path is to start the app and paste your key into the Settings screen. It is then
# held in your OS keychain (desktop app) or in the dev server's memory (browser mode), and is
# never written into the repo.
#
# This variable exists only as a fallback for automation, where there is no one to type into a
# settings screen. Copy this file to `.env` to use it. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
